{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_253051b837434b2f9689ff8d1f52a923","id":"pg_1439b194c98b5fe3afde9d65b4b7c4d1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/sahithvibudhi-vibe-tree-changelog-md-f88907703af1-9d65b4b7c4d1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_3ec77a77e5f4521984dde91c683b065e"],"title":"sahithvibudhi/vibe-tree/CHANGELOG.md @ f88907703af1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_253051b837434b2f9689ff8d1f52a923"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_038be0631a5b316ce43a12c48361046d211de994430d6a8a7bf263b734a821e9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors run pnpm install, pnpm dev:desktop/dev:all, unit tests via pnpm test:run, Playwright e2e suites, and pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint; CI runs lint, typecheck, unit tests, builds, and e2e."},{"claim_ids":["clm_120f33a32db1906d70eb6c1aca5d13617c1a12398a21dae3bedbbfb481bfd98b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The standalone server reaps sessions idle beyond SESSION_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS (default 24h), while the desktop keeps sessions until quit."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6bbfe589dc93ac98ce2be6097884687e70eaa6e5474380c79c60a604e33c1847"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The desktop app embeds its server on 127.0.0.1 with a per-launch token so nothing is exposed to the network; the standalone server can require login via AUTH_REQUIRED, VIBETREE_USERNAME, and VIBETREE_PASSWORD."},{"claim_ids":["clm_74a17aba42834e1f0e713c9438b121100c15d01e0ba6464f2cc54d8e68a9ae54"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Build tooling documented includes esbuild bundles for core/ui/auth, tsc for server-core and apps/server, Vite for desktop renderer and web, electron-builder packaging, and vite-plugin-pwa."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8fb9f574f371febe578a617ec7c39e2a18a695554bbaf486f6238a6a4c045ada"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Terminal sessions survive disconnects: session IDs are deterministic per worktree path and terminal ID, output is buffered from PTY start, and reattach returns the scrollback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a44f0c79ca66c5d069a7fed306baef60599721a5dd1dee1868cc18e6aa689789"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repo is a pnpm + Turborepo monorepo with apps (desktop, web, server) and packages (core, server-core, ui, auth), where desktop and web share one backend."},{"claim_ids":["clm_aaa5312f9f39baa65d5b282b8f736630451866492506c76c26ee1375ac01d675"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Electron IPC is reserved for native OS concerns (dialogs, notifications, theme, IDE launching, settings, menus), while app logic goes through the embedded server over WebSocket."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b865c942a485e261dccbb5de74fbaebe92e34c7b134ffbcac9a65e3497e748e4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ShellSessionManager in packages/core owns all PTYs, one per worktree+terminal, buffering bounded (~100KB) output for replay on reconnect."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ce7a94b59158215c517165eb840a3daefebfdd24819507bcbff0e75e30d942f5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"All shell and git traffic uses a single WebSocket protocol (shell:* and git:* messages) via a shared WebSocketAdapter used by both desktop renderer and web app."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d97f765257bbed3b802b64d586ca3a8f2a6139b8d4888e3b87cc5e68fd6466db"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Authentication is off by default; the standalone server runs unauthenticated in its default mode and only warns when bound to 0.0.0.0 without auth."},{"claim_ids":["clm_db6fedb16fd6d15dffc4b1d1aa9c491ac9f2c450f8e6a2406264bd173e66ceb5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Worktree lifecycle hooks (.vibetree/hooks/post-create and pre-remove) run around git worktree add/remove; failures warn but never block, and pre-remove cannot block deletion."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e665bba61dedeba4332280ee61f483389303b23b9c92b03eeba5dd0307ce192e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"It ships as an Electron desktop app and as a standalone server drivable from any browser or phone, including QR pairing for mobile access."}],"claim_ids":["clm_038be0631a5b316ce43a12c48361046d211de994430d6a8a7bf263b734a821e9","clm_120f33a32db1906d70eb6c1aca5d13617c1a12398a21dae3bedbbfb481bfd98b","clm_6bbfe589dc93ac98ce2be6097884687e70eaa6e5474380c79c60a604e33c1847","clm_74a17aba42834e1f0e713c9438b121100c15d01e0ba6464f2cc54d8e68a9ae54","clm_8fb9f574f371febe578a617ec7c39e2a18a695554bbaf486f6238a6a4c045ada","clm_a44f0c79ca66c5d069a7fed306baef60599721a5dd1dee1868cc18e6aa689789","clm_aaa5312f9f39baa65d5b282b8f73663045